__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# C17: secrets should only ever come from the environment, never a
# committed file. GROQ_API_KEY and friends belong in a local .env that
# must never be tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db

# Streamlit's own secrets convention (GROQ_API_KEY, DATABASE_URL locally
# during auth testing, etc.) -- same rule as .env above, just Streamlit's
# specific filename for it. Was missing here entirely until the auth
# work below needed a local secrets.toml to test the DATABASE_URL path.
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# C19: AliasStore's cache (A9) persists to disk by design (a 2nd run
# should make zero LLM calls), but that means it's local dev-instance
# state, never something to commit -- found while bug-bashing when a
# stray copy from a manual test run silently changed a later pytest
# run's behavior.
alias_cache.json
